  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.25,
   "end": 1.229,
   "text": "TEN YEARS from now,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 1.229,
   "end": 3.301,
   "text": "your life could look COMPLETELY DIFFERENT."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 3.421,
   "end": 4.855,
   "text": "And one of the BIGGEST reasons"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 4.855,
   "end": 6.464,
   "text": "might be what you decide to do"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 6.464,
   "end": 7.709,
   "text": "with your money TODAY."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 8.009,
   "end": 9.651,
   "text": "You don't need to be RICH to begin."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 9.771,
   "end": 12.366,
   "text": "Imagine saving just $100 each month,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 12.366,
   "end": 14.773,
   "text": "while LEARNING how to start a SMALL BUSINESS"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 14.773,
   "end": 16.555,
   "text": "with SKILLS you already have."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 16.855,
   "end": 19.928,
   "text": "If you invested $100 EVERY MONTH"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 19.928,
   "end": 20.471,
   "text": "for 10 YEARS,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 20.471,
   "end": 22.167,
   "text": "you'd put in $12,000."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 22.287,
   "end": 24.876,
   "text": "At an AVERAGE 7% yearly return,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 24.876,
   "end": 27.535,
   "text": "it COULD grow to about $17,000!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 27.835,
   "end": 29.691,
   "text": "Or imagine starting a SMALL BUSINESS."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 29.811,
   "end": 32.414,
   "text": "Your FIRST customer might only pay $50."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 32.534,
   "end": 34.032,
   "text": "But by IMPROVING your skills"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 34.032,
   "end": 35.32,
   "text": "and finding MORE CUSTOMERS,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 35.32,
   "end": 37.867,
   "text": "you could slowly build something MUCH BIGGER."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 38.167,
   "end": 39.703,
   "text": "Of course, some businesses FAIL,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 39.703,
   "end": 41.559,
   "text": "and investments can LOSE money."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 41.679,
   "end": 44.363,
   "text": "But 10 years of LEARNING, SAVING, and IMPROVING"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 44.363,
   "end": 45.939,
   "text": "can give you OPPORTUNITIES"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 45.939,
   "end": 47.61,
   "text": "you might never have had otherwise."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 47.91,
   "end": 49.682,
   "text": "You don't have to become a MILLIONAIRE"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 49.682,
   "end": 50.705,
   "text": "to CHANGE YOUR LIFE."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 50.825,
   "end": 53.332,
   "text": "Having SAVINGS, useful SKILLS, and more CHOICES"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
